string":"迷途骑士 4 护甲 S","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000E47|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightArmorSC4"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 0 Helmet Decorative Crest SMP","string":"迷途骑士 0 头盔装饰冠饰 SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F85|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightHelmetCrestSMPC0"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 1 Helmet Decorative Crest SMP","string":"迷途骑士 1 头盔装饰冠饰 SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F8B|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightHelmetCrestSMPC1"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 2 Helmet Decorative Crest SMP","string":"迷途骑士 2 头盔装饰冠饰 SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F8C|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightHelmetCrestSMPC2"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 3 Helmet Decorative Crest SMP","string":"迷途骑士 3 头盔装饰冠饰 SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F8D|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightHelmetCrestSMPC3"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 4 Helmet Decorative Crest SMP","string":"迷途骑士 4 头盔装饰冠饰 SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F8E|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightHelmetCrestSMPC4"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 1 Skirt - SMP","string":"迷途骑士 1 裙甲-SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F97|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightSkirtSMPC1"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 2 Skirt - SMP","string":"迷途骑士 2 裙甲-SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F98|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightSkirtSMPC2"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 3 Skirt - SMP","string":"迷途骑士 3 裙甲-SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F99|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightSkirtSMPC3"},{"original":"Wayward Knight 4 Skirt - SMP","string":"迷途骑士 4 裙甲-SMP","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000F9A|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightSkirtSMPC4"},{"original":"Wayward Knight Tassets B","string":"迷途骑士腿甲片 B","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000FA0|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"ARMO FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightTassetsB"},{"original":"Crumpled Letter","string":"揉皱的信","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000845|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"BOOK FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightLoreLetter"},{"original":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">As a child, you made me swear to Stendarr to embody His mercy. Even then, unable to grasp the complexities of the politicking you were anchoring me to, I knew what it meant to do good. \r\n\r\nThis oath was never really to the Divine - it wasn't to the Order of the Mailed Fist, nor master Burchard; it was to the courtiers who rule us from within Daggerfall.\r\n[pagebreak]\r\nYears wasted, trained and equipped to be the steward of some distant lord's holdings, not a keeper of the people around me. The Derosa family were once loved, and in breaking this bond, I will reclaim that. \r\n\r\nIn turn, you're welcome to reclaim my equipment, though you will find my absence from your ranks has not changed my preference for maneuverability.","string":"<font face=\"$HandwrittenFont\">小时候，你让我向斯丹达尔起誓，要体现祂的仁慈。即便那时的我还无法理解你把我拴在其中的政治纠葛，我也知道行善意味着什么。\r\n\r\n这份誓言从来不是向圣灵许下的——不是向铁拳骑士团，也不是向伯查德师父；而是向那些在匕落城内统治我们的朝臣许下的。\r\n[pagebreak]\r\n多年光阴白白浪费，我被训练、被装备，只为去当某个远方领主领地的管家，而不是守护身边的人。德罗萨家族曾受人爱戴，斩断这层束缚，我要把那份爱戴夺回来。\r\n\r\n相应地，欢迎你收回我的装备，不过你会发现，即便我离开了你的队伍，我对机动性的偏好也从未改变。","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000845|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"BOOK DESC","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardKnightLoreLetter"},{"original":"Wayward Chest","string":"迷途骑士箱子","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000E91|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"CONT FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardChest"},{"original":"Wayward Variant Chest","string":"迷途骑士变体箱","status":"TranslationRequired","form_id":"02000E92|ahzWaywardKnight.esp","type":"CONT FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"a0WaywardChestVar"},{"original":"Skyrim","string":"天际","status":"TranslationComplete","form_id":"0000003C|Skyrim.esm","type":"WRLD FULL","index":null,"editor_id":"Tamriel"}]